{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07165","headline":"岁夜喜魏万成郭夏雪中相寻 · 刘长卿","name":"岁夜喜魏万成郭夏雪中相寻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新年欲变柳，旧客共沾衣。\n岁夜犹难尽，乡春又独归。\n寒灯映虚牖，暮雪掩闲扉。\n且莫乘船去，平生相访稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}